Sarasa Mono J, K, SC, and TC, release v1.0.42
https://github.com/be5invis/Sarasa-Gothic/releases/tag/v1.0.42

The regular and bold TTF files were compressed to WOFF2 with fontTools.
No glyphs were removed. To reproduce each conversion with Python:

from fontTools.ttLib import TTFont
font = TTFont('SarasaMonoSC-Regular.ttf')
font.flavor = 'woff2'
font.save('SarasaMonoSC-Regular.woff2')

Repeat for Bold and for the J, K, and TC families.
